 and billionaire hedge fund manager Steve Cohen.","L'Homme au doigt"],"21410978":["Large Standing Woman I is a bronze sculpture created by Alberto Giacometti in 1960.","Large Standing Woman I"],"65120595":["Tête qui regarde, also known as Gazing Head, is a 1928–29 sculpture by Alberto Giacometti. It has been described as Giacometti's first truly original work.","Tête qui regarde"]},"titlesFrom":["fr","P1476","alias:en","alias:fr","aliasFilter:1"]}